DESCRIPTION:The Repair Café at CNIB Bayview runs from 11 AM to 2 PM. The p
 rimary focus of this event is on repairing accessibility devices such as P
 erkins braillers\, white canes\, electronic magnifiers\, talking and brai
 lle watches\, and sewing-related repairs. The Repair Café does not charge
  for repairs\, it is free! We encourage individuals to RSVP in advance to 
 secure priority for repairs\, although walk-ins are also welcome. While th
 e event primarily serves the blind and visually impaired community\, we ma
 y accommodate individuals outside of this community based on availability 
 and foot traffic. The Repair Café at the CNIB Bayview is usually held eve
 ry two months on the third Saturday. CNIB is at 1929 Bayview Ave\, Toronto
 . For further details or inquiries\, please feel free to contact Dom at D
 om.Chan@cnib.ca.
